OL,3,GNEWSASocial housing flats approved for
OL,4,ARamsey
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty social housing flats have been
OL,7,Funanimously approved for a brownfield
OL,8,Fsite in Ramsey.
OL,10,FThe development will replace a vacant
OL,11,Fplot that has sat empty for years and
OL,12,Fwas previously home to sheltered
OL,13,Fhousing and part of a primary school.
OL,15,FAll the flats will be two-bedroom, let
OL,16,Fout by Ramsey Town Commissioners as
OL,17,Fpublic sector rentals to help cut its
OL,18,Fown housing waiting list.
OL,20,FCommittee members said homes like these
OL,21,Fwere "desperately needed" on the
OL,22,FIsland.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
